Z||000000||sqoach||07-23-2001||12:11 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>My 86 SE just got her first kill! Yay!<BR>I was just cruising the strip and noticed this red early 90s BMW following me. I knew he wanted to race. I just cruise along and a stoplight turns red. He gets in the other lane. The light turns green before we get there. (fast light) He revs his engine at me, then I rev my beastly no-cat V6 back at him. There's another stoplight ahead, so I wait. We're almost to a stop, then the light turns green. We look right at each other, then I throw it in 1st. *Chirp* Vrroooommm...I have him by a car length, throw it in 2nd, still a car length ahead. Well, I have to slow it down cuz there's a truck in front of me, and I don't feel like crashing. Then he flies by me, and slows down after passing me. Guess he thought he won. I figure he would turn back around, but I see him turn off onto a street.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>*No kittens or old lady's were harmed. I think I might have run over a donut, though...hehe*<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||10
