Z||000013||sqoach||07-25-2001||02:59 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>Just don't take on a 6 cylinder BMW Sqoach. I drove an old 535i once and got it to leave rubber in 3 gears. They fly. <P>Musta been that paintjob I did for you   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, I just raced him for the hell of it. Just wanted to test how my car could really go. I can chirp 2nd, but just a tiny chirp. I only did it once, because I don't like having my rpm's high. I heard you can spin a bearing by always having the rpm's up. I don't know about the paint helping me out, but it looks better in my sig. Too bad my car doesn't look that good  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
